          "params": [],
          "returnType": null,
          "description": "Upper bound on the taps one sweep may take per side, as a cost cap. Omit it and the tap count follows strength on its own, which is the usual case; set it to trade smoothness for texture fetches on a weak device. Capping does not shorten the blur: the taps still span the full kernel, so a cap well below the derived count widens their spacing and can show as banding. The ceiling is 32 either way."
        },
        {
          "name": "strength",
          "signature": "strength?: number",
          "signatureTokens": [
            {
              "text": "strength",
              "kind": "name"
            },
